# Food

== food_react ==
I'm starving.                {glutton, w=2}
I could eat.
I've been thinking about [favorite_food.s] all day. {w=1.5}
I've been craving [favorite_food.a]. {glutton, w=2}
Is it just me, or is it nearly dinnertime? {time=evening}
Breakfast. Most important meal there is. {time=morning, glutton}

== food_detail ==
Nothing beats [favorite_food.a] after a long day.
[favorite_food.cap] [favorite_food.is] the best thing there is. {w=0.8}
You know what I can't stand? [hated_food.s.cap]. {w=0.8}
Don't ever offer me [hated_food.a]. I mean it. {w=0.6}
My stomach's been growling since noon. {glutton}
Haven't had a proper meal in days. {pessimist}
A good meal fixes most things. {optimist}
I'd eat it every day if I could. {glutton}
The Cube God gives us bread. We ought to be thankful. {pious}

== food_ask ==
You eaten yet?
What about you?
What's your favorite?        {curious}
You any good at cooking?     {curious}
Want to share something?     {polite}

== food_reply ==
Don't get me started.        {glutton, w=2}
Me? I'd go for [favorite_food.a]. {w=1.5}
Now you've made me hungry.
I'm not fussy.               {humble}
I'm not fussy. Anything but [hated_food.s]. {w=0.8}
Food is food.                {serious}
Mm.                          {taciturn, w=2}

== chat_open_food ==
[listener]! [food_react] [food_detail?] [food_ask?]
[food_react] [food_detail?] [food_ask?]

== chat_reply_food ==
[food_reply] [food_detail?]

