# Home, and the place they're in

== home_react ==
I miss [home_biome.the].     {at_home=no}
I've been thinking about [home_biome.the]. {at_home=no}
Some days I wonder why I ever left [home_biome.the]. {at_home=no, sentimental, w=2}
Nothing like home.           {at_home=yes}
Good to be home.             {at_home=yes, w=1.5}
I could never leave [home_biome.the]. {at_home=yes, sentimental}

== home_detail ==
The air's different there.   {at_home=no}
We'd never put up with cold like this back home. {at_home=no, home_climate=hot, climate=cold, w=3}
Back home it never gets this hot. {at_home=no, home_climate=cold, climate=hot, w=3}
This place is all right, I suppose. {at_home=no, biome_like=meh}
This place is growing on me. {at_home=no, biome_like=like}
This place is growing on me. {at_home=no, biome_like=love}
I don't know how anyone lives here. {at_home=no, biome_like=hate}
I know every path around here. {at_home=yes}
My family's always been here. {at_home=yes, w=0.8}
Born here, and I'll die here, Cube God willing. {at_home=yes, pious}

== home_ask ==
Where are you from?
Ever been there?             {at_home=no}
Do you ever miss home?       {sentimental}
Are you from around here?    {curious}

== home_reply ==
I'm from [home_biome.the], myself. {at_home=no, w=2}
Me, I miss [home_biome.the]. {at_home=no}
I never left [home_biome.the]. {at_home=yes, w=2}
Home's wherever I'm standing. {lighthearted}
I don't think about it much. {serious}
Mm.                          {taciturn, w=2}

== chat_open_home ==
[listener]. [home_react] [home_detail?] [home_ask?]
[home_react] [home_detail?] [home_ask?]

== chat_reply_home ==
[home_reply] [home_detail?]
